    {
      "content": "Okay, great. Before we get estimating I can share how we work when it comes to the no worries, damage coverage. So we treat your furniture like it's our own everything gets padded before it leaves the room and not just for your furniture, your floors and walls and doorways too on the way out, and on the way in. On the rare occasion something does get damaged or no worries damage coverage kicks in automatically. And that is up to $2,000 per move included at no extra cost, no deductible, no fine print and that's built into your hourly rate and then we resolve claims in 46 days on average, if anything were to happen and then just so you know we do value your time. So, if we are late we start discounting and move immediately. If we don't make that agreed upon arrival window, we take $50 off right away for the first hour than $25 more every half hour after that does that all make sense.",
